# Django API layer

- Full policy: `.agents/policies/django-api.md` and `.agents/policies/integration.md`.
- Consumer: Angular app in sibling `../auto-repair-shop-front`. Prefer explicit, stable HTTP contracts and validated OpenAPI.
- Scope user-owned querysets before lookup. Keep the standard error envelope and legacy keys required for compatibility.
- Additive migrations only unless destruction is explicitly approved. Test against PostgreSQL behavior.
- Do not commit/push/deploy/migrate production without authorization.
- Prefer delegating substantive API work to the `django-api` subagent with a filled `.agents/HANDOFF.md` block.
